      "sourceTextSha256": "25a8f8d7dcecd8b227876e9f4f4e789634bca086640c331f53044b74023c8798",
      "text": "After an early breakfast, we say goodbye to Confluencia and start an 8-to-9-hour hike, crossing the “Playa Ancha” and climbing the steep “Cuesta Brava.” We will arrive at Plaza de Mulas, the largest camp in Aconcagua Park, a true city in the heart of the mountain. The staff will welcome us with a well-deserved welcome meal after the effort made.\n\nAccommodation: Double/triple tent or Dorm Dome – Meals included: Breakfast, packed lunch, and Dinner",
